    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Co-Op Bike Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You share control between two players! Each has their own role. Cooperate, communicate, and play together\u2014because you have one goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player controls the throttle, keeping you safe from deadly traps, while the other steers, finding the best path\u2014the path to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master teamwork, or the journey will be nearly impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.poster.avif?t=1755685762\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.webm?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.mp4?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strictly for Two!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed for cooperative play\u2014you\u2019ll need a reliable partner who\u2019s ready to work as a team. Grab a friend, a family member, or just a daring soul willing to take on this challenge with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Going solo? Not an option!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.poster.avif?t=1755685762\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.webm?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.mp4?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test Your Friendship and Teamwork!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two friends decide to take on an unusual challenge\u2014a tandem bike race, that take place at huge height. But they never expected the road to the competition to be this dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make it to the top, you'll have to navigate through office buildings, busy highways, and even construction sites\u2014where every obstacle will test your teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unforgettable adventure filled with challenges and excitement awaits!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Grand Journey Through Ever-Changing Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic landscapes and unexpected obstacles will keep you on your toes. From peaceful amusement parks to chaotic construction zones, every location is unique and demands a fresh approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You never know what\u2019s waiting around the next corner.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Challenge for Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four difficulty levels let you choose your challenge:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy \u2014 </strong>a relaxed playthrough with frequent checkpoints.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal \u2014 </strong>the challenges get tougher, as checkpoints appear less often.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard \u2014 </strong>only a few checkpoints across the entire map.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanity \u2014 </strong>no mercy and no checkpoints, pure focus and skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to prove you can conquer any height?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Co-Op Bike Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You share control between two players! Each has their own role. Cooperate, communicate, and play together\u2014because you have one goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player controls the throttle, keeping you safe from deadly traps, while the other steers, finding the best path\u2014the path to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master teamwork, or the journey will be nearly impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.poster.avif?t=1755685762\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.webm?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.mp4?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strictly for Two!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed for cooperative play\u2014you\u2019ll need a reliable partner who\u2019s ready to work as a team. Grab a friend, a family member, or just a daring soul willing to take on this challenge with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Going solo? Not an option!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.poster.avif?t=1755685762\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.webm?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.mp4?t=1755685762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test Your Friendship and Teamwork!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two friends decide to take on an unusual challenge\u2014a tandem bike race, that take place at huge height. But they never expected the road to the competition to be this dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make it to the top, you'll have to navigate through office buildings, busy highways, and even construction sites\u2014where every obstacle will test your teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unforgettable adventure filled with challenges and excitement awaits!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Grand Journey Through Ever-Changing Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic landscapes and unexpected obstacles will keep you on your toes. From peaceful amusement parks to chaotic construction zones, every location is unique and demands a fresh approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You never know what\u2019s waiting around the next corner.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Challenge for Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four difficulty levels let you choose your challenge:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy \u2014 </strong>a relaxed playthrough with frequent checkpoints.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal \u2014 </strong>the challenges get tougher, as checkpoints appear less often.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard \u2014 </strong>only a few checkpoints across the entire map.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanity \u2014 </strong>no mercy and no checkpoints, pure focus and skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to prove you can conquer any height?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Become a true team in this unique co-op game for two! Take control of a single bike and overcome the toughest challenges to reach the peak. Jump, maneuver - Are you ready to prove you can conquer any height?",
